#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:1
#: 85e9bb0ea2294ddba3d827c69da89545
msgid "用一条流程学会构建数据集卡片系统"
msgstr "Learn the Make Dataset card system through one workflow"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:3
#: 3b4b18caa7bf41ba808df8325ee23c98
msgid ""
"这不是四张卡片的功能介绍，而是一个完整的工作流示例。目标是从 2 原子的 Si "
"晶胞出发，同时生成掺杂和空位两类候选，再做小幅扰动和几何筛选。走完一次后，你应该能看懂卡片顺序、`分支合并` "
"分支、启停状态、输入输出数量以及流程复用方式。"
msgstr ""
"This is not a feature tour of four separate cards. It is one complete "
"workflow: start from a two-atom Si cell, generate doped and vacancy "
"candidates in parallel, then apply a small perturbation and geometry "
"filtering. After completing it once, you should understand card order, "
"`Branch Merge` branches, enabled and disabled states, input and output "
"counts, and workflow reuse."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:5
#: 417077efaaf742338e37a38a390cbb8f
msgid "先认清卡片和右侧检查器"
msgstr "Understand the Cards and the Inspector"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:7
