msgid "卡片在中间画布中显示顺序、摘要和运行状态；选中卡片后，参数及文档入口出现在右侧检查器："
msgstr ""
"Cards on the center canvas show their order, summary, and run status. "
"Select a card to edit its parameters or open its documentation in the "
"inspector on the right:"

