#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:9
#: 42981d6d6c9b4aae8bc5657d8bc8422b
msgid "复制当前卡片和参数，之后可从左侧当前工作流区域粘贴"
msgstr ""
"Copy the current card and its parameters. You can paste it later from the"
