#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:9
#: e2b7349bfeb94b52bc083ff4430d11a9
msgid "从工作区移除；不会删除已经导出的文件"
msgstr "Remove it from the workspace. Previously exported files are not deleted."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:23
#: 4e6a2e51a71942feae8fb02bf9e4bcfb
msgid "运行成功后，卡片上才会出现“查看本卡输出”和“导出本卡输出”。拖动卡片标题栏可以调整顺序。改完顺序必须重新运行，因为顶层卡片的输出会依次传给下一张已启用卡片。"
msgstr ""
"The `View this card's output` and `Export this card's output` actions "
"appear only after the card runs successfully. Drag a card by its title "
"bar to change the order. Run the workflow again after reordering because "
"each top-level card passes its output to the next enabled card."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:25
#: 11900a4e717f4536abc4cca29004c565
msgid "组装这个例子"
msgstr "Build the Example"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:27
#: 916e21f9d620495987ccb264f39ceccb
msgid "用左上角 `Load` 导入 `Si2.vasp`。"
msgstr "Use `Load` in the upper-left corner to import `Si2.vasp`."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:28
#: 90e9428f8c3a44ce856659131c845898
msgid ""
"用 `添加新卡片` 打开卡片选择器，依次添加 `扩胞`、`分支合并`、`随机掺杂`、`全局空位`、`原子扰动` 和 "
"`几何健全性过滤`。没有选中容器时，新卡片进入顶层。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Add new card` to open the card picker, then add `Super Cell`, "
"`Branch Merge`, `Random Doping`, `Global Vacancy`, `Atomic Perturb`, and "
"`Geometry Sanity Filter` in that order. When no container is selected, a "
"new card is added at the top level."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:29
#: a09bc76fb1c84dda96e6a880a35cbedd
msgid "按住 `随机掺杂` 的标题栏，把它拖进 `分支合并` 的空白区域；再用同样方法拖入 `全局空位`。拖错时，把子卡片拖回工作区空白处即可回到顶层。"
msgstr ""
"Drag `Random Doping` by its title bar into the empty area of `Branch "
"Merge`, then do the same with `Global Vacancy`. If a card is grouped by "
"mistake, drag it back to an empty area of the workspace to return it to "
"the top level."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:30
#: 7b7708733da442289b6f4cac8fdf18ca
msgid "拖动标题栏，把剩余顶层卡片排成下面的顺序，再填写参数。"
msgstr ""
"Drag the title bars to arrange the remaining top-level cards as shown "
"below, then enter the parameters."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:32
#: 7aeb9afe30024a9f926de606d45d600b
msgid ""
"扩胞\n"
"→ 分支合并 [随机掺杂 | 全局空位]\n"
"→ 原子扰动\n"
"→ 几何健全性过滤\n"
msgstr ""
"Super Cell\n"
"→ Branch Merge [Random Doping | Global Vacancy]\n"
"→ Atomic Perturb\n"
"→ Geometry Sanity Filter\n"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:39
#: ef8639ad77734662a13f73c41622a424
msgid "包含线性步骤和并行分支的完整卡片流程"
msgstr "A complete card workflow with sequential steps and parallel branches"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:39
#: ef8639ad77734662a13f73c41622a424
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/card_system_workflow.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/card_system_workflow.png"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:44
#: b56cbdbf011848a69d82ce7d86a8dba7
msgid ""
"中间工具栏的 `运行` 运行所有已启用卡片，`停止` "
"中止正在运行的卡片。复制或粘贴整条工作流从左侧“当前工作流”区域操作；右侧检查器的复制按钮只复制当前卡片，两者不要混用。"
msgstr ""
"`Run` in the center toolbar runs every enabled card, while `Stop` "
"interrupts cards that are still running. Copy or paste an entire workflow"
" from the current-workflow area on the left. The copy button in the "
"inspector copies only the selected card; do not confuse the two "
"operations."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:46
#: 705acc48a7324f459341850a30d04dce
msgid "本例使用的参数只用于把数据流讲清楚："
msgstr "These parameters are chosen only to make the data flow easy to follow:"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:39
#: 06c8598f84334520bf8e2fefcc78b6e6
msgid "步骤"
msgstr "Step"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:39
#: 1ded129c41c24145a7bb07263a8b8e65
msgid "关键输入"
msgstr "Key settings"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:39
#: c761c487e78b44edb5272b1a1e00f1c1
msgid "预期输出"
msgstr "Expected output"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:39
#: c7194c6ea0fd49f0bedc41417f40f84f
msgid "`扩胞`"
msgstr "`Super Cell`"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:39
#: 66bab297303a4fc89cba553d0ea726a5
msgid "`2 × 2 × 2`"
msgstr "`2 × 2 × 2`"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:39
#: fa566160debe4861b4e445dd2b504c47
msgid "1 个 16 原子 Si 超胞"
msgstr "One 16-atom Si supercell"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:39
#: 6d06f02b88424f18a057382d10a8a27e
msgid "`随机掺杂`"
msgstr "`Random Doping`"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:39
#: 1d8505f2ac8e4668bc544a26c3b64b55
msgid "目标 `Si`；掺杂元素直接填 `Ge`；固定替换 1 个；生成 2 个；seed `42`"
msgstr ""
"Target `Si`; enter `Ge` directly as the dopant; replace exactly 1 atom; "
"generate 2 structures; seed `42`"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:39
#: 761ccd9609974a1498b2fbe7909c2d12
msgid "2 个 `Si15Ge`"
msgstr "Two `Si15Ge` structures"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:39
#: 54242fdfaf3a4d6cbcb5400e32386d25
msgid "`全局空位`"
msgstr "`Global Vacancy`"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:39
#: f454ab43ce6d41eba502123247829094
msgid "固定移除 1 个原子；生成 2 个；seed `42`"
msgstr "Remove exactly 1 atom; generate 2 structures; seed `42`"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:39
#: 4da61c00ffc94a13af484355d94bd0a1
msgid "2 个 15 原子 Si 空位结构"
msgstr "Two 15-atom Si vacancy structures"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:39
#: 5ba5651a6dc645e5aa4dcd42eaaf13c3
msgid "`原子扰动`"
msgstr "`Atomic Perturb`"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:39
#: ca6e2455387c41d59a6b2c5ccd5a3cb4
msgid "最大位移 `0.05 Å`；每个输入生成 2 个；seed `42`"
msgstr "Maximum displacement `0.05 Å`; generate 2 structures per input; seed `42`"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:39
#: 4a2c0e4ba2f94b409cef7890e9a5a146
msgid "$4\\times2=8$ 个扰动结构"
msgstr "$4\\times2=8$ perturbed structures"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:39
#: 30d57e0509814900ab9a66bd2bc0b219
msgid "`几何健全性过滤`"
msgstr "`Geometry Sanity Filter`"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:39
#: cfef98e86d464262bf4c0870b336b940
msgid "最短距离 `1.5 Å`；要求有限晶胞"
msgstr "Minimum distance `1.5 Å`; require a finite cell"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:39
#: ef4beeeb6609437db1bfc62256032489
msgid "筛掉明显碰撞或无效晶胞"
msgstr "Remove obvious collisions and invalid cells"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:56
#: bf2f81e8cbb44a3885649eb1f0d36653
msgid ""
"掺杂元素输入框不是 JSON。单一元素直接写 `Ge`；多元素比例写 "
"`Ge:0.7,C:0.3`。界面恢复已保存参数时也会保持这种写法，便于直接照着修改。"
msgstr ""
"The dopant field does not use JSON. Enter `Ge` for one element or "
"`Ge:0.7,C:0.3` for a multi-element ratio. Restored settings keep this "
"editable notation so you can copy and adjust it directly."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:58
#: f2dec4279be6424c95da08f874c59301
msgid "线性链和分支合并不要混淆"
msgstr "Do Not Confuse a Sequential Chain with Branch Merge"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:60
#: 07093fabed2944a1b91436e9dd0222d4
msgid ""
"顶层卡片是**串行**的：`扩胞` 的输出进入 `分支合并`，分支汇总结果再进入 `原子扰动`，最后交给 "
"`几何健全性过滤`。所以扩胞应放在缺陷生成前，筛选应放在随机生成后。"
msgstr ""
"Top-level cards run **sequentially**: the output of `Super Cell` enters "
"`Branch Merge`, the merged branch result enters `Atomic Perturb`, and the"
" result finally goes to `Geometry Sanity Filter`. This is why supercell "
"expansion belongs before defect generation and filtering belongs after "
"random generation."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:62
#: 3b7a8e57a94f43f282dd9e190fd3c468
msgid "`分支合并` 内部是**独立分支**。本例的掺杂卡和空位卡都收到同一个 16 原子 Si 超胞，它们不会前后相接："
msgstr ""
"Cards inside `Branch Merge` are **independent branches**. In this "
"example, both the doping card and the vacancy card receive the same "
"16-atom Si supercell; one does not feed into the other:"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:64
#: 65ff509c20fd4f749b0d099f087cf2c8
msgid ""
"Si16 → 分支合并 ┬→ 随机掺杂 ┬→ 汇总为 4 个结构\n"
"                └→ 全局空位 ┘\n"
msgstr ""
"Si16 → Branch Merge ┬→ Random Doping  ┬→ merge into 4 structures\n"
"                    └→ Global Vacancy ┘\n"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:69
#: b274381fe41742698d7205ea385bc287
msgid ""
"只有“同一个输入要走几条不同路线”时才使用 `分支合并`。如果你想先掺杂、再从掺杂结构中造空位，就应把两张卡放在顶层，按 `随机掺杂 → "
"全局空位` 排列，而不是放进同一个组。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Branch Merge` only when the same input should follow several "
"independent routes. If you want to dope first and then create vacancies "
"in the doped structures, place both cards at the top level in the order "
"`Random Doping → Global Vacancy` instead of putting them in the same "
"group."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:71
#: 8e6a348aeb3f4bd0afb4d2d18d87ca9c
msgid "运行后沿着数量检查"
msgstr "Check the Counts after Running"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:73
#: 2a5b27d8f7f64cfc97f385c8ae8ff0f6
msgid "勾选需要参与流程的卡片，点击顶部 `运行`："
msgstr "Select the cards that should participate, then click `Run` at the top:"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:75
#: 8850f782980647719695a561a4d90844
msgid "卡片流程各步骤的真实输入输出数量"
msgstr "Verified input and output counts for every workflow step"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:75
#: 8850f782980647719695a561a4d90844
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/card_system_result.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/card_system_result.png"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:80
#: 106fca016c4e4827b2db9fd9fb768291
msgid "本例真实运行结果为："
msgstr "The verified result of this example is:"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:82
#: cb167f46f4ce413ea268cc3de25349b7
msgid ""
"1 个 Si2\n"
"→ 1 个 Si16\n"
"→ 2 个 Si15Ge + 2 个 Si15，共 4 个分支结果\n"
"→ 8 个扰动结构\n"
"→ 几何健全性过滤后保留 8 个\n"
msgstr ""
"1 Si2 structure\n"
"→ 1 Si16 structure\n"
"→ 2 Si15Ge + 2 Si15 structures, giving 4 branch results\n"
"→ 8 perturbed structures\n"
"→ 8 structures retained by Geometry Sanity Filter\n"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:90
#: 005252c59c8941028fbbe3d5dfff9b6b
msgid ""
"每张卡底部都显示 `Input → Output / "
"Time`。数量从哪一步开始不符合预期，就先检查那一步，不要只看最终文件。如果某张卡输出为空，流程会停在这里，下游卡片不会继续运行。"
msgstr ""
"Each card shows `Input → Output / Time` at the bottom. If a count first "
"becomes unexpected at a particular step, inspect that step instead of "
"checking only the final file. If a card produces no output, the workflow "
"stops there and downstream cards do not run."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:92
#: 5d9ffc7b25f34819bcfd9b1f7a18f0b6
msgid "运行完成后有三种查看或导出范围："
msgstr "After the run, there are three viewing or export scopes:"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:94
#: 6f49e719c7194ed28878bbaf1da30ddf
msgid "卡片上的查看、导出按钮：只处理这一张卡片的输出。"
msgstr "The view and export actions on a card operate only on that card's output."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:95
#: 57fbfd758ea64e24929dec5c4ebdb512
msgid "中间工具栏的 `查看输出`：合并查看所有已勾选且已经产生结果的卡片，包含中间步骤。"
msgstr ""
"`View output` in the center toolbar combines the outputs of all checked "
"cards that already have results, including intermediate steps."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:96
#: 54bac15fc0ae4d469c16d123d3e4586b
msgid "页面级导出动作中的 `导出工作流最终输出`：只保存最后完成的已启用卡片输出；`导出全部可用卡片输出` 用于保留全部中间结果。"
msgstr ""
"Among the page-level export actions, `Export final workflow output` saves"
" only the output of the last completed enabled card; `Export all "
"available card outputs` keeps every intermediate result."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:98
#: 3e5f31feb4a44f36bff020b7d7219f41
msgid "保存的是结构，还是流程"
msgstr "Are You Saving Structures or the Workflow?"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:100
#: b08190b8346a41faaee0e42c96cefa02
msgid "这两个概念必须分开："
msgstr "Keep these two concepts separate:"

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:102
#: 7b978190e0ae4892aa279294a2d013f2
#
msgid "左侧 `另存为工作流` 保存卡片顺序、参数和启停状态，**不包含生成结构**。"
msgstr "`Save as workflow` on the left saves card order, parameters, and enabled or disabled states. It **does not include generated structures**."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:103
#: 898dc04eabf343e98fad665e68e9b846
msgid "当前工作流区域的粘贴动作会把剪贴板中的单张卡片、卡片列表或完整流程追加到当前工作区，不会自动清空原卡片。"
msgstr ""
"The paste action in the current-workflow area appends a single card, a "
"card list, or a complete workflow from the clipboard to the current "
"workspace. It does not clear the existing cards."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:104
#: dd7478204e1c4255a97df30f4c127a47
msgid "更多菜单中的导入、导出动作可用于交换工作流 JSON 文件。"
msgstr ""
"Use the import and export actions in the More menu to exchange workflow "
"JSON files."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:105
#: d63527b4f2b243c1826b15f8ce3aa426
msgid "导出卡片输出或最终流程输出，保存的才是结构数据。"
msgstr ""
"Exporting a card output or the final workflow output is what saves "
"structure data."

#: ../../source/example/card-system-workflow.md:107
#: 3e98c3d7f68246bc9c7249633f091bf1
msgid ""
"第一次把流程调通后，建议在工作流库中保存并命名。需要在其他机器使用时再导出 "
"JSON。更换输入结构时先检查元素、原子数和晶胞是否仍满足这些参数，再运行；不要把同一份流程配置当作所有材料都适用的物理方案。"
msgstr ""
"After the workflow works as intended, save it in the workflow library and"
" give it a descriptive name. Export JSON only when you need to use it on "
"another machine. Before running with different input structures, check "
"that their elements, atom counts, and cells still satisfy the configured "
"parameters. Do not treat one workflow configuration as a physically valid"
" recipe for every material."

